<title>FRANCE: SWIMMING-WARNECKE BREAKS 50 METRES BREASTSTROKE WORLD RECORD.</title>
<headline>SWIMMING-WARNECKE BREAKS 50 METRES BREASTSTROKE WORLD RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Mark Warnecke set a 50 metres breaststroke shortcourse swimming world record in 26.97 seconds at a World Cup meeting on Saturday.</p>
<p>Warnecke had set the previous record of 27.00 in February 1995 in Gelsenkirchen, Germany.</p>
